e, expensive, require special equipment and training, are not\nusually necessary to make the diagnosis, and have not been found to affect outcome. These studies, however, are important\nwhen invasive therapy is planned.\n\n(Option B) Imaging studies other than ultrasound are not often required for the diagnosis of urinary incontinence, except in\nselected cases.\n\n(Option C) Surgical procedures are used for patients with stress urinary incontinence, who have failed to respond to more\nconservative treatment such as pelvic floor muscle exercises.\n\n(Option E) Bladder training should be offered as a first-line treatment for overactive bladder symptoms such as frequency or\nurgency in patients with urge and mixed incontinence. It also may be beneficial for patients with stress incontinence in\ncombination with pelvic floor muscle exercise.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","management","therapy","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"3010d0c87fd16da8be14ee6e525e46252b844eb0","duplicate_group_id":"exact-3010d0c87fd1","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"8c1e90a7f3762a705ca9","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Renal &Urology amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Renal &Urology amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":2,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"6534ea9a1e2684e7c13b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Urology _ Neurology 1-40 .pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Urology _ Neurology 1-40 .pdf","source_page":62,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"c99a8d9c2787e0293ff4","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Urology _ Neurology 1-40 .pdf","source_