t and in what settings. Circumstances under which a renal biopsy might be considered are\nwhere the patient is not a surgical candidate (controversial), life expectancy is <5 years (controversial), or the patient requests a definite\ndiagnosis before proceeding with the surgery. Biopsy is not recommended for patients who are candidates for active surveillance.\n\n(Option D) Given this clinical picture, the tumour is likely malignant; therefore, reassurance cannot be given unless investigations exclude\nmalignancy.\n\n(Option E) Ablation of renal mass can be performed with either freezing (cryoablation) or heat (radiofrequency or microwave ablation). Using a\npercutaneous approach, a needle is used to ablate the tumour with the heat of freezing. After ablation, all patients should undergo surveillance\nto assess for residual or recurrent tumours that would require additional therapy. Although initial studies have shown favourable short-term\nresults with thermal ablation, long-term outcomes are yet to be studied. Thermal ablation is reserved for patients with a small RCC who are not\ncandidates for surgery. In addition, ablation is a treatment option for RCC after partial nephrectomy, for those with a unilateral or transplanted\nkidney, or for patients at risk for multiple RCCs over their lifetime.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","interval","management","therapy","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"9415de165664bb118da22067114bb6cef853a63e","duplicate_group_id":"exact-9415de165664","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"c9050e912f5486ed4f3c","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Renal &Urology amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Renal &Urology amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":18,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"9799e5f1cc78813683f2","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Urology _ Neurology 1-40 .pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Urology _ Neurology 1-40 .pdf","source_page":101,"source_qid":null}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
