Which one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?',NULL,'E','Forced vital capacity (FVC) is the amount of air that a patient can exhale in a single expiration after a deep
inspiration, no matter how long it takes. FVC is diminished (less than 80% predicted) in restrictive pulmonary
